Here are the lines you'll want for your .gitignore file, plus a few other common Lisp/SBCL artifacts you'll definitely want to ignore.

Code snippet


# VS Code editor metadata
.vscode/

# Compiled executables
bin/


# === Recommended Lisp / SBCL ===

# Compiled Common Lisp "fast-load" files (binaries)
*.fasl

# Emacs/Slime backup and lock files
*~
.#*

# Any local executable
*.exe